<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Time 6-mth net down 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Time 6-mth net down 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   9.19   vs	  14.19</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	  2.8    vs	   5.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   408.21   vs	 291.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    24.06   vs	  21.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.27   vs   add   2.66</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    nil    vs   add   5.36</p>
<p>    Dividend		     nil    vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Time Engineering Bhd is involved in telecommunications, media and power businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
